{"seq":2,"slug":"intelligent-construction","title":"智能建造工程","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":6,"docCount":14,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction","introMarkdown":"# 智能建造工程 简介\n\n智能建造工程是职业本科教育中面向建筑业数字化转型的战略性新工科专业，将土木工程与人工智能、物联网、机器人技术深度融合，培养能够驾驭BIM全生命周期管理和智慧工地运营的高端技术技能人才。2026年教育部批准的职业本科专业目录中，智能建造工程（专业代码240302）被列为重点发展方向，全国已有数十所职业技术大学开设该专业。\n\n本专业以\"懂数智、精操作、善管理\"为培养核心，课程体系横跨建筑力学、结构设计、BIM技术、智能装备、绿色建造等多个领域，毕业生能够胜任建筑智能化施工、BIM项目管理、装配式建筑深化设计等高技术岗位。\n\n第一章**建造基础与BIM**夯实工程力学、建筑材料、建筑制图等专业基础，重点训练BIM建模与协同设计能力，使学生掌握从二维图纸到三维信息模型的核心技能转换。\n\n第二章**智能建造技术**聚焦建筑业智能化前沿，涵盖智能测量与物联网感知、建筑机器人与自动化施工、3D打印建造技术三大方向，培养学生运用新技术解决复杂工程问题的能力。\n\n第三章**智慧工地管理**围绕施工现场信息化，深入讲解智慧工地平台搭建、工程质量与安全管理、项目进度与造价数字化管控，使学生具备现代化工程项目全过程管理能力。\n\n第四章**绿色装配式建筑**响应\"双碳\"战略，系统介绍装配式建筑设计与制造、绿色建筑评价标准、城市更新与既有建筑智能运维，培养学生参与新型建筑工业化实践的综合素质。\n\n建议学习路径：先通过第一章建立扎实的工程基础和BIM技能，再在第二章学习前沿智能技术，然后通过第三章将技术与管理结合，最终在第四章的绿色建造实践中形成完整的职业能力体系。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"construction-fundamentals-bim","title":"建造基础与BIM","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/construction-fundamentals-bim","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"engineering-mechanics-materials","title":"工程力学与建筑材料","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/construction-fundamentals-bim/engineering-mechanics-materials"},{"seq":2,"slug":"architectural-drawing-cad","title":"建筑制图与CAD","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/construction-fundamentals-bim/architectural-drawing-cad"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bim-modeling-applications","title":"BIM建模与应用","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/construction-fundamentals-bim/bim-modeling-applications"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"construction-fundamentals","title":"建筑工程基础","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/construction-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"engineering-mechanics-materials","title":"工程力学与建筑材料","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/construction-fundamentals/engineering-mechanics-materials"},{"seq":2,"slug":"architectural-drawing-cad","title":"建筑制图与 CAD","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/construction-fundamentals/architectural-drawing-cad"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"bim-digital-design","title":"BIM 与数字化设计","docCount":0,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/bim-digital-design","docs":[]},{"seq":4,"slug":"intelligent-construction-tech","title":"智能建造技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/intelligent-construction-tech","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"intelligent-measurement-iot","title":"智能测量与物联网","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/intelligent-construction-tech/intelligent-measurement-iot"},{"seq":2,"slug":"construction-robotics-automation","title":"建筑机器人与自动化施工","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/intelligent-construction-tech/construction-robotics-automation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"3d-printing-digital-fabrication","title":"3D打印与数字制造","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/intelligent-construction-tech/3d-printing-digital-fabrication"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"smart-site-management","title":"智慧工地管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/smart-site-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"smart-site-platform","title":"智慧工地平台","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/smart-site-management/smart-site-platform"},{"seq":2,"slug":"quality-safety-management","title":"工程质量与安全管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/smart-site-management/quality-safety-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"project-cost-schedule","title":"项目造价与进度管控","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/smart-site-management/project-cost-schedule"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"green-prefabricated-building","title":"绿色装配式建筑","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/green-prefabricated-building","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prefabricated-design-manufacturing","title":"装配式建筑设计与制造","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/green-prefabricated-building/prefabricated-design-manufacturing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"green-building-standards","title":"绿色建筑评价标准","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/green-prefabricated-building/green-building-standards"},{"seq":3,"slug":"urban-renewal-maintenance","title":"城市更新与智能运维","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/green-prefabricated-building/urban-renewal-maintenance"}]}]}